// core — primitive operations, memory, assertions (fsht-03:01,
// ch. 23 §5): the assert family and the freshet.* intrinsics.  Both
// are compiler-known surfaces (assert/const_assert builtins and the
// freshet.* intrinsic namespace), usable without any import — this
// module is the decomposition's anchor for them.
//
//   assert(cond)          — aborts the program on false
//   const_assert(expr)   — compile-time assertion (F0219/F0220)
//   freshet.prefetch_r/w, freshet.clflush, freshet.pause
//   freshet.cycles, freshet.time_ns, freshet.time_ms, freshet.threads
//   freshet.machine_* profile intrinsics and
//   freshet.assume_aligned (see modules/machine.fsht for the named
//   surface)
module core;
